Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:12.02,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 ATP1000 第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:12.02,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}门西克 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}6-3 6-4{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 土方凛辉 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.74,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, congratulations. Clearly tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜 今晚很明显
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.74,0:00:05.74,EN,,0,0,0,,you had a power advantage, but he's an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.74,0:00:05.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,你在力量上占优 但他很聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.56,0:00:08.16,EN,,0,0,0,,intelligent player and he made it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.56,0:00:08.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,他让你很难
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.16,0:00:09.52,EN,,0,0,0,,difficult for you to find a rhythm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.16,0:00:09.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,找到自己的节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.52,0:00:11.56,EN,,0,0,0,,tonight. How did you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.52,0:00:11.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚打下来什么感觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:13.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh, absolutely. I mean, first of all,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:13.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,确实是这样 首先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:15.54,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm really happy that after a very tough
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:15.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很高兴 首轮那场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:17.82,EN,,0,0,0,,physical first round that I was able to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:17.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,体能上非常艰苦的比赛之后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.82,0:00:20.82,EN,,0,0,0,,come and I felt really good. Different
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.82,0:00:20.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,我今天上场感觉很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.76,0:00:24.52,EN,,0,0,0,,conditions compared to two days ago
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.76,0:00:24.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,和两天前相比 条件不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.52,0:00:27.46,EN,,0,0,0,,playing under the lights. Even like you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.52,0:00:27.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,是在灯光下打的夜场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:29.66,EN,,0,0,0,,said, the power was on my side. I could
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:29.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,就像你说的 力量在我这边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.66,0:00:31.34,EN,,0,0,0,,feel it as well. But at the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.66,0:00:31.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,我自己也感觉得到 但同时
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:32.82,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, the conditions were super slow
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:32.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天的场地特别慢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.82,0:00:35.82,EN,,0,0,0,,today. So it was really, really tough to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.82,0:00:35.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以真的非常非常难
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.08,0:00:39.08,EN,,0,0,0,,get the rhythm. It's not easy to face
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.08,0:00:39.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,找到节奏 这种条件不好打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.36,0:00:41.20,EN,,0,0,0,,these kind of conditions. And like you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.36,0:00:41.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且像你说的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.20,0:00:43.56,EN,,0,0,0,,said, Rinky, he's a tricky player, you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.20,0:00:43.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,土方是个很难缠的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.56,0:00:46.56,EN,,0,0,0,,know, he's pretty fast. So it was very
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.56,0:00:46.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,他速度很快 所以
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.50,0:00:50.50,EN,,0,0,0,,tough for me to, you know, to end up the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.50,0:00:50.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很难把一分终结掉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:54.50,EN,,0,0,0,,points. But I was serving very, very
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:54.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我今天发球非常非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.72,0:00:56.74,EN,,0,0,0,,well. And I had a lot of opportunities
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.72,0:00:56.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,接发上也拿到了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.74,0:00:58.64,EN,,0,0,0,,on the return. So I'm grateful that I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.74,0:00:58.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,很多机会 我很庆幸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.64,0:01:01.64,EN,,0,0,0,,took in each set of all of them. And I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.64,0:01:01.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,每一盘都把它们抓住了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.78,0:01:03.24,EN,,0,0,0,,was the happier one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.78,0:01:03.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后开心的那个是我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.24,0:01:05.26,EN,,0,0,0,,Really strangely, he won 80 percent of
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.24,0:01:05.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,有点反常的是 他今天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.26,0:01:07.38,EN,,0,0,0,,his points on second serve today, which
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.26,0:01:07.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,二发得分率有百分之八十
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.38,0:01:10.02,EN,,0,0,0,,is kind of odd. On return, what was the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.38,0:01:10.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,这不太常见 接发这一头
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.02,0:01:11.76,EN,,0,0,0,,difficulty today?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.02,0:01:11.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天难在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.76,0:01:14.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean, I mean, his first serve
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.76,0:01:14.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得 他的一发成功率
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.96,0:01:16.74,EN,,0,0,0,,percentage was pretty high. That's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.96,0:01:16.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天相当高
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.74,0:01:18.82,EN,,0,0,0,,probably, you know, as well, like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.74,0:01:18.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,这大概也是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.82,0:01:21.82,EN,,0,0,0,,something that it's something that it's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.82,0:01:21.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,一件不太寻常的事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.62,0:01:26.62,EN,,0,0,0,,not that usual. But yeah, I mean, it's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.62,0:01:26.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过我刚才也说了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.20,0:01:29.90,EN,,0,0,0,,like I said, the fact that the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.20,0:01:29.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,场地条件比较慢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.90,0:01:31.60,EN,,0,0,0,,conditions were slower, it was very
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.90,0:01:31.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一点让我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.60,0:01:34.60,EN,,0,0,0,,tough for me to find the rhythm. Not
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.60,0:01:34.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,很难找到节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.68,0:01:38.20,EN,,0,0,0,,just in the ground strokes, but also on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.68,0:01:38.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,不只是底线相持
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.20,0:01:39.26,EN,,0,0,0,,the return.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.20,0:01:39.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,接发也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.26,0:01:40.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Level of confidence, though, the way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.26,0:01:40.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,说到信心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.56,0:01:41.48,EN,,0,0,0,,you're playing at the moment, the way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.56,0:01:41.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,你现在打成这个样子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.48,0:01:42.78,EN,,0,0,0,,you're building on the hard courts. How
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.48,0:01:42.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,在硬地上一场场垒起来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.78,0:01:44.16,EN,,0,0,0,,good do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.78,0:01:44.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,你自己感觉有多好？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.16,0:01:47.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean, after Wimby, you know, I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.16,0:01:47.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,温网之后我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.98,0:01:50.88,EN,,0,0,0,,take some time off. I did really good
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.98,0:01:50.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,休息了一段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.88,0:01:52.46,EN,,0,0,0,,preparation with my team on the hard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.88,0:01:52.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,和团队在硬地上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.46,0:01:55.02,EN,,0,0,0,,courts. And yeah, feeling really great,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.46,0:01:55.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,做了很扎实的准备 感觉非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.02,0:01:56.82,EN,,0,0,0,,especially in Montreal here in
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.02,0:01:56.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是在蒙特利尔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.82,0:01:58.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Cincinnati. Already played a really
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.82,0:01:58.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有辛辛那提这里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.48,0:02:01.48,EN,,0,0,0,,couple of great matches. So I'm saying
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.48,0:02:01.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,已经打了好几场很好的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.00,0:02:04.86,EN,,0,0,0,,that I must say that, of course, it's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.00,0:02:04.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然 我得说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.86,0:02:07.00,EN,,0,0,0,,really great to have these kind of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.86,0:02:07.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,美网之前能有这样几场球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.00,0:02:10.00,EN,,0,0,0,,matches in my back before the U.S. Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.00,0:02:10.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,垫在身后 真的很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.52,0:02:12.02,EN,,0,0,0,,Good job. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.52,0:02:12.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,打得好 谢谢
